title: Lock released before the async save completes
flags: data-loss
--- body
`_lock.Release()` runs before `SaveChangesAsync` is awaited, so a second
writer can enter while the first save is still in flight.
--- suggestion
await _db.SaveChangesAsync(ct);
_lock.Release();
